{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-matalan-baby-sleeping-bags-2603-0245","content_id":"bae1dc20-7181-4dd5-8d6f-96c6d0b332cf","description":"Product Recall of Matalan Baby Sleeping Bags presenting a risk of suffocation.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"8a96c749-2439-4351-8bf3-b1cef9947f9e","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-04-08T13:07:12+01:00","id":"8a96c749-2439-4351-8bf3-b1cef9947f9e","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-04-08T13:07:12+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d644f02ea7bc150a394ac4/2603-0245-product-recall-matalan-sleepbags.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Matalan Baby Sleeping Bags</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of suffocation as the neck opening can stretch during use, allowing the baby to slip inside the bag.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Matalan</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Swaddle Blanket/Wrap Cloth</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Matalan Retail ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Range of patterned infant sleep bags.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_8a96c749-2439-4351-8bf3-b1cef9947f9e\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d644f02ea7bc150a394ac4/2603-0245-product-recall-matalan-sleepbags.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"affected-product-codes\">Affected Product Codes</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Sales Period</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Code</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Barcode</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Matalan Winnie the Pooh and Lumpy Sleep Bag</td>\n      <td>7 July 2025 to 13 March 2026</td>\n      <td>C295792</td>\n      <td>295792000019</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Matalan Bambi Sleep Bag</td>\n      <td>25 August 2025 to 13 March 2026</td>\n      <td>C295833</td>\n      <td>295833000015</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Matalan Dumbo Sleep Bag</td>\n      <td>25 August 2025 to 13 March 2026</td>\n      <td>C295842</td>\n      <td>2295842000020</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Matalan Tatty Ted Sleep Bag</td>\n      <td>3 November 2025 to 12 March 2026</td>\n      <td>C296328</td>\n      <td>296328000015</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Matalan Winnie the Pooh Sleep Bag</td>\n      <td>12 January 2026 to 12 March 2026</td>\n      <td>C296559</td>\n      <td>2296559000013</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a risk of suffocation as the neck opening can stretch during reasonably foreseeable use. This may lead to the baby slipping inside the product during normal sleep movements, and suffocating.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users by Matalan.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend that consumers stop using this product immediately and return it to the nearest Matalan store for a full refund. No receipt is required.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, please see:  <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.matalan.co.uk/c/customer-services/product-recall-notice/\">https://www.matalan.co.uk/c/customer-services/product-recall-notice/.</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2603-0245</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-08T12:08:13Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"affected-product-codes","level":3,"text":"Affected Product Codes"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-04-08","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-04-08T13:08:13+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-matalan-baby-sleeping-bags-2603-0245","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-matalan-baby-sleeping-bags-2603-0245","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-matalan-baby-sleeping-bags-2603-0245","content_id":"bae1dc20-7181-4dd5-8d6f-96c6d0b332cf","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-04-08T12:08:13Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Matalan Baby Sleeping Bags (2603-0245)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-matalan-baby-sleeping-bags-2603-0245","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recall